<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- American States downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- American States downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Boston on Tuesday it said lowered its rating on American States Financial Corp's stock to hold from buy.  </p>
<p>-- First Boston analyst Charlie Gates said he downgraded the shares after news on Monday that SAFECO agreed to pay about $2.8 billion for the Lincoln National Corp unit.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
